{
 "fps": 30,
 "voiceDuration": 81.4,
 "tempo": 1.0704,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": 1,
   "scene": "S1",
   "text": "Adam was standing right next to her\u2026 and he didn't say a word.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 3.886,
   "phrases": [
    1,
    2,
    3,
    4
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "scene": "S1",
   "text": "We always blame Eve. But read it slowly.",
   "start": 4.484,
   "end": 7.268,
   "phrases": [
    5,
    6
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "scene": "S2",
   "text": "\u201cShe took of the fruit thereof, and did eat, and gave also unto her husband with her; and he did eat.\u201d",
   "start": 7.735,
   "end": 13.789,
   "phrases": [
    7,
    8,
    9,
    10,
    11,
    12
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "scene": "S3",
   "text": "With her. He was there the whole time.",
   "start": 14.098,
   "end": 16.583,
   "phrases": [
    13,
    14,
    15
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "scene": "S4",
   "text": "He heard the snake. He watched her reach. And he said nothing.",
   "start": 16.891,
   "end": 20.749,
   "phrases": [
    16,
    17,
    18
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 6,
   "scene": "S5",
   "text": "That evening, they heard God walking in the garden\u2026 and they hid.",
   "start": 21.366,
   "end": 24.963,
   "phrases": [
    19,
    20,
    21,
    22
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 7,
   "scene": "S6",
   "text": "God called: \u201cWhere art thou?\u201d",
   "start": 25.262,
   "end": 26.962,
   "phrases": [
    23,
    24
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 8,
   "scene": "S7",
   "text": "And Adam said: \u201cThe woman whom thou gavest to be with me, she gave me of the tree, and I did eat.\u201d",
   "start": 27.289,
   "end": 32.951,
   "phrases": [
    25,
    26,
    27,
    28,
    29
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 9,
   "scene": "S7",
   "text": "He blamed her. And he blamed God.",
   "start": 33.259,
   "end": 35.651,
   "phrases": [
    30,
    31
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 10,
   "scene": "S8",
   "text": "Then Eve said: \u201cThe serpent beguiled me.\u201d",
   "start": 35.959,
   "end": 38.603,
   "phrases": [
    32,
    33
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 11,
   "scene": "S9",
   "text": "Everyone pointed at someone else.",
   "start": 38.976,
   "end": 40.733,
   "phrases": [
    34,
    35
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 12,
   "scene": "S10",
   "text": "We still do it. My parents. My friends. My past. Even God.",
   "start": 41.032,
   "end": 45.376,
   "phrases": [
    36,
    37,
    38,
    39,
    40
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 13,
   "scene": "S11",
   "text": "But notice. God didn't call Eve first. He called Adam.",
   "start": 46.161,
   "end": 49.907,
   "phrases": [
    41,
    42,
    43
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 14,
   "scene": "S12",
   "text": "The Bible says: \u201cBy one man sin entered into the world.\u201d",
   "start": 50.187,
   "end": 53.653,
   "phrases": [
    44,
    45,
    46
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 15,
   "scene": "S13",
   "text": "Thousands of years later\u2026 another Man stood in a garden.",
   "start": 53.962,
   "end": 57.297,
   "phrases": [
    47,
    48,
    49
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 16,
   "scene": "S14",
   "text": "Soldiers came with torches. And He didn't hide. He stepped forward: \u201cI am he.\u201d",
   "start": 57.997,
   "end": 63.463,
   "phrases": [
    50,
    51,
    52,
    53
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 17,
   "scene": "S16",
   "text": "Then He said: \u201cLet these go their way.\u201d He protected His friends.",
   "start": 63.78,
   "end": 67.788,
   "phrases": [
    54,
    55,
    56
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 18,
   "scene": "S17",
   "text": "Adam hid and passed the blame. Jesus stepped out\u2026 and took it.",
   "start": 68.078,
   "end": 71.871,
   "phrases": [
    57,
    58,
    59,
    60
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 19,
   "scene": "S17",
   "text": "\u201cHe hath made him to be sin for us, who knew no sin.\u201d",
   "start": 72.459,
   "end": 75.57,
   "phrases": [
    61,
    62,
    63
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 20,
   "scene": "S18",
   "text": "So stop passing it. Just bring it to Him.",
   "start": 75.851,
   "end": 78.27,
   "phrases": [
    64,
    65
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 21,
   "scene": "S19",
   "text": "Who do you blame for your mistakes? Be honest.",
   "start": 78.85,
   "end": 81.381,
   "phrases": [
    66,
    67,
    68
   ]
  }
 ],
